WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.432
Before publishing a reusable object, review more than the SQL.

00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:08.407
State the grain. Review what the interface exposes.

00:00:08.407 --> 00:00:11.812
Document freshness. Inspect dependencies.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:16.502
And identify ownership of the business definition and operational process.

00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:22.307
These questions turn a view from an ad hoc query into a maintainable interface.

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:27.552
A standard view stores a query definition, not a separate copy of the rows.

00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:34.772
Treat the selected columns, names, types, and grain as a contract with downstream users.

00:00:34.772 --> 00:00:41.422
Changing that contract can break dashboards or applications even if the underlying query still runs.
